{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ce4f30ce6f5f1b694afd06f2695367f0c4345c7757193207bfc5925b307a6e23",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7de0bb1db2d84f336a0b3dd37d0ba38170ca2f25aaa849ad9776c6c664537e",
      "text": "特别生日蛋糕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a9487916628b2ab9561f05cef90202ada8167781a3ccba7f3539e95ff15c609",
      "text": "生日临近的某一天，庄一郎被幸广告知了\n生日派对的计划。\n在被问到有什么想吃的或想要的愿望时，\n庄一郎提出了一个请求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7de0bb1db2d84f336a0b3dd37d0ba38170ca2f25aaa849ad9776c6c664537e",
      "text": "特别生日蛋糕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339b2e3ae91eede25643ca66fd226dfb70ef56c7a546c9464fe7eb4d5bc622fc",
      "text": "东云。能占用点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:797706ed56bb7d0cf00e8042d2606df98bb597c171ced36f368d76d16055011f",
      "text": "好的。请问有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58cd64a4eb697dedaf5116bf2a37cc66738a4088b8a2e85effa43dbbae743066",
      "text": "马上就是东云的生日了吧。我和Cafe Parade的\n大家，正在策划你的生日派对呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65964039d0152308e1bf0b58ebcf1b52cf48b281b86202c9657d016c310cd89c",
      "text": "所以，想问问你有什么想吃的、想要的，\n听听你的愿望……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34f3f2348cf067392f05cd2f016d7e8cb93dcc45c17b012a9555b195215c5e74",
      "text": "哎呀。\n原来不打算给我搞惊喜啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1957e264c57fd6c0d00f7c56034a1abded205edc5f2d600acf9b5b366f3ea6f9",
      "text": "反正不管怎样都会被东云看穿的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2118e2e7cecf37ee2b2d051a509e2f0d3b74a6f34b771a05ccca2d952c362fe5",
      "text": "呵呵，原来是这样啊。\n让我想想，要是能为我庆祝的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5de3bd8a37cebd879f43ae92a55a12f05733901f9050359bbb586cbdc890606e",
      "text": "既然如此，我想尝尝大家亲手做的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ba169677fe18b4fef13f71653546badd3893ebdc9ee1ffb73d064efa4973a7",
      "text": "蛋糕吗。完全没料到啊。大家听了\n大概也会吓一跳吧。我知道了，我会转告他们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc37ff64ed69461c5732f4982899957b04f37594149b55b35bca9fc99560ad75",
      "text": "谢谢。\n我会好好期待的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000025:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8bf93142363f4dd916071ec316f501acff509c1afb7323667589f5b3bdfb8f6",
      "text": "事情就是这样，东云好像想尝尝我们亲手做的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7071338407829e75a3f42f3140b72a24e7eccdff99399171aaed98abbb29c4bd",
      "text": "哎！\n做给作为蛋糕专家的庄一郎先生吃吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7833325f21c1f4fa2ae4267c37313b47fc641950ea3708f795b84e4e5430c181",
      "text": "嚯……这可得集结吾等之魔力了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f87d6c8f8a395e892a4fae840f3352c38043fdaf72273d532517a33f910e8e4",
      "text": "嗯！做一个让庄一郎大吃一惊的、\n超棒的蛋糕吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d31673fd380a38e47d3c78d2a284aac2dd4913d7cee19c5c01cc939136f7be5",
      "text": "我也会帮忙的！\n如果有什么需要的东西，请随时告诉我哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbbd59ec40fb2620666080f6047671a0c7b48eb669b1f7f69fc3419c2a1482f1",
      "text": "说到蛋糕，那果然是蛋糕卷了吧！\n卷绪已经有什么想法了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a9f6bc83e2bce2dd1562dd9e7f5685af7e43f3a1fac7a3cab7e2aa1091162b",
      "text": "嗯。不过，果然还是大家一起想吧？\n去找找看有什么有趣的蛋糕吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87f1186c73a7e6d4eb322436b35c637fa9f71e12bd62f5a41b05f15d95dedc5e",
      "text": "让我想想……这个怎么样？虽然外表\n普普通通，但切开来海绵蛋糕是彩虹色的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82fa1cc9b3e79b45eaabdb3fa45d8bbc4aab0e4b0126bec545456dfabc8e49e2",
      "text": "嘿，色彩真丰富啊。\n这种蛋糕好像也很有意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5972e5f55a275dbbcac9f853aca572ba76fa7a3ecb464c40680228bf68cc61c",
      "text": "啊，这个蛋糕也很有趣哦。\n据说是机关蛋糕呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c221b12e384428830146c848b6b35b2cf51c2e20d1b57a201f293a11c7072a8e",
      "text": "何等惊人……自四分五裂的诱惑供物之中，\n溢出了黑暗的碎片。竟是这般怪异……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:019f45d4a403c161c5193947b6c8988ffe3407cfc5750e349ff42eaba2b2b8f1",
      "text": "很独特的蛋糕呢。\n这到底是怎么做出来的呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:654359f7d71bb6e98b48a49367b15b634bfe47dcdd6f4ffad508900933a41203",
      "text": "每一个蛋糕都难分高下啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f36b5748205655674261c72ea3968041e43a6adf1e5d403e064c62cb887c820",
      "text": "既然如此，便在罪孽深重的诱惑供物之上，绘制召唤序列第60号恶魔……\n瓦普拉的魔法阵吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_b:cmd-000209:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a6c3bf1a22d0eba7e8ac27d71fc28bf2074dc9225061c31d2c3f9fae3700ac5",
      "text": "每一种都很棒呢！确认一下各自的食谱，\n寻找我们能做出来的蛋糕吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a0776c7d1271ab84fe811f3f147768caeb97918b8e3a86c1bdd041e535a17e4",
      "text": "……看了各种各样的款式，但光靠我们的话，做立体的\n蛋糕好像有点困难呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b86a9adbdbdad65e702faf9ed0a65f0b9a7542fbf107a3f11abb967d11a42c8d",
      "text": "是啊……啊，这个怎么样？\n用奶油做出花朵的形状。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f76a38f96a8a76be0f8d8b5085a1deee98c8db1a170acece31b3f5a9d4480362",
      "text": "这个的话感觉我们也能做到！那么，\n做成庄一郎的生日花怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:038478c624124d541f1ede6cd55a5e3cbe83ffc064b3ca4b5adb56a0a7f8fdad",
      "text": "哦，好主意啊！\n堕天使撒旦亦深表赞同！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ade0491f65cc621b9447cf7c90bc82493373e0f4c9bd9778f422fabac6922f65",
      "text": "嗯，不错呢。为了能把花朵裱得漂亮，\n在东云生日之前大家一起好好练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000099:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db658cd7beb4c37bb1ac47b71404eed97ecfddaa560a202f21e7bff16380c025",
      "text": "那么，今天也来进行蛋糕的试做吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feaf9714bae38ea674530b78cb8f28b14b958be28d7a648d2e171c73211496f5",
      "text": "嗯♪把奶油一点一点挤出来……\n是这种感觉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1799009dffdab92007e67717a41122caa05c000835c95686cff6121dedc5ccef",
      "text": "不愧是咲，进步真快啊。\n我看起来还需要多多练习呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:066c814539fad1f8fb62a10039d7e3f9b4bac49c07c7104496f6ec780782801e",
      "text": "唔嗯……因魔力饱和而导致花瓣扭曲了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_c:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8932c0728d6629ff12e08b95443b8d0567523d6e96a60bc1bcf631966af96bc",
      "text": "但是，大家越来越熟练了！\n按照这个势头继续练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000028:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c377b584f7bbb02a588193ea44928f29fe92b1bdc23d7b7234f90a34520347db",
      "text": "制作人，今天也辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a72507ca8c9ac9ae8bcd960c6eda79026ba265119ab53ac192240a2aa40bf63f",
      "text": "庄一郎先生拍摄也辛苦了。\n今天应该已经没有别的安排了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3c7ff20344500d1eb7fa8bfbe19af99e29eb671d68e06cfb97d6492fe1ded58",
      "text": "是的，接下来只要回家就好。不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75a8aa1fc581bc8f2b9ddf0db708248128628622fb208b77188aa37d5b41647c",
      "text": "其他成员似乎还有安排呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbfa00af299cda8ca88d1441a36e9a26fb94b9c81852bc43a9e4925786042aaa",
      "text": "呵呵。大家好像都在为了我的生日\n而努力着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4701a41958a3aab954176ca46a40b3f53c578a7b775142b7c8c6f51c71f10ab7",
      "text": "Cafe Parade的厨房里，\n还残留着甜甜的香气哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a49803924e7f74d5ad3f9590d43e1c8cc31dbc2c7bcb5f6d231f184626d97c54",
      "text": "单是这样，就已经让我产生了一种\n收到了礼物般的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9070ba2b7fe2e9deae3360711c3f37b3082acebc9b23331d529f9ae1660d2f70",
      "text": "重头戏还在后面呢！\n请期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48aae2d25917ede3dc64106a86ba7b4900337f35dd144f836da11061b97fe642",
      "text": "是呢。会端出什么样的蛋糕呢，\n我很期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000125:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b196ea13d8d7d5243f3e88926df0f0ea0bbbab708b2ccfb7c173f42e4aa3",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d841bb6a2f95881fc5038af5e4c9e59d68ae37c1db680de1d2bef0bf75bfe94f",
      "text": "生日快乐，东云！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63e45888da2ccb1057d1a961f5c46de6381b531956b2e71bec24d7cc8d8920bc",
      "text": "伴随着堕天使撒旦，向庄一郎\n献上祝福吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d45ffa97b5a7913a748a9cae987d085efbd36303dfade575f7bb4dbd6492d8ea",
      "text": "生日快乐，庄一郎♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b1388cad12fb245b00b4a5cc3c63868e4ee7710a77bdf9d33791c6db095fd5b",
      "text": "生日快乐，庄一郎先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e310da3dc7b2bfaca63869ee2953704960114b108656bbe191fc06567035e4",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_d:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:527f3065a321a719ae4d8779e39a22922ac0d7313e1944c0b202281c82f038fa",
      "text": "虽然有些突然，\n不过我有样东西想让庄一郎看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9d0a6e6cd6c6876e9e1f430fb0bf0a10d1d10a42e0851941e1fe41c622f9f11",
      "text": "铛铛——！是Cafe Parade特制的\n特别生日蛋糕哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4c7c035776bc25342656aab256951aa069ffd0142a8f628293332f26253be95",
      "text": "里面凝聚着我们的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203e37f62ec0a53a018f55718faba3121d0349b2fef399c7cececab1b100325a",
      "text": "这是……点缀着许多鲜花的蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86b4efe000219434966a7a5bda175aaedab192232b937de2881b7abd7010ad77",
      "text": "是东云的生日花哦。\n大家一起画出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aaa6c36b013cc38bb18680bf0bb2f05befb9fbc748266a68ad68c8f5b0736f0",
      "text": "嗯，倾注了吾等的魔力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95432b577690e2854cd72a472a29cdd42fd5d86fdfcc9a11b11ea217faf2d7ea",
      "text": "是大家倾注了心血完成的力作！\n每天都有在练习哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d60c719b0dcd5778984e7aed76dad3f5e764d8966ff07cb77ad03f68787e53",
      "text": "这朵花是制作人画的！这边是\n我画的花！啪噼地努力过啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d14347bf0fef0baae5a00fa568a6b7083cf83600716e8e1a2b8dbe1647ad7de",
      "text": "海绵蛋糕也是力作哦。得到了卷绪的认可，\n肯定能让你赞叹不已的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f13d6172e26b52ba554a06b4dd6b518ce98cb8d3b0ab1e929f761029878c1532",
      "text": "那我就来切蛋糕了。\n……来，最大的一块给庄一郎先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09151d923b8d5e88e0c62d6f39b221e15389c12ddda06511888fca8d7945b045",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n那么，我立刻就来尝尝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f689e28b6ae11e9b60a217945fa2a45481be4c7c199f75eb09dca6d62cb39a55",
      "text": "……真美味。不仅是味道，\n大家的心意我也切实感受到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c580433e06a78ebb434f105f3f355c4521e1ff58cbb7616a66b084ac00cba4",
      "text": "谢谢你们回应了我的心愿。\n这成为了我一生的美好回忆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_e:cmd-000202:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cf6da8f4de60d987573bc53b638669d0b126b3c544c334669c4d939273e6e80",
      "text": "那真是太好了。再次祝你生日快乐。\n希望你的接下来这一年，能够过得很棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
